      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "`web_safari` and `web` formats are returning `The page needs to be reloaded.. The page needs to be reloaded.` errors with yt-dlp `2026.03.03`, but not with `2026.03.17`. Thus, no 1080p YouTube video playback in VRChat with the currently used VRChat yt-dlp `2026.03.03`.\n\nSee: https://ask.vrchat.com/t/avpro-player-vizvid-plays-low-resolution-yt-videos/48357/4",
